    'summary': 'GP network / VBHC care coordination platform with inpatient management and portals',
    'description': """
Healthcare Operations Platform (v4 - Consolidated)
==================================================
Complete healthcare ERP layer for GP networks and primary-care groups:

* Practice management and CRM-linked onboarding
* Patient registry, appointments, consultations, referrals
* Care plans, coordinator cockpit, chronic disease registry
* Lab requests/results, prescriptions, allied sessions
* CDS alerts + scheduled reminder/escalation automation
* Population health analytics (SQL report)
* Inpatient / bed / ward / admission management with bed transfers
* Patient, GP, and care coordinator portals
* Public patient self-registration
* Demo data seeder wizard
* Ops / clinical KPI dashboards
    """,
